    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I noticed a few things<div><br></div><div><ul><li>dist<b>p</b>lot in ui.R and dist<b>P</b>lot in server.R. R is case sensitive, careful.</li></ul></div><div><ul><li>reactive(...) actually returns a function, so you need to called it<b>()</b> to get the value from it</li></ul><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\">See the updated code in the gist, note that I generated a tu data.frame,  you need to replace those lines with your original read.csv code </span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></div><div><a href=\"https://gist.github.com/xiaodaigh/6632557\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gist.github.com/xiaodaigh/6632557&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792406954390000&amp;usg=AOvVaw03lssn9sIh4ruajUbGK9TN\">https://gist.github.com/xiaodaigh/6632557</a><br></div><div><br><div>shiny::runGist(6632557)</div><div><br></div><div>&lt;script src=&quot;<a href=\"https://gist.github.com/xiaodaigh/6632557.js\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gist.github.com/xiaodaigh/6632557.js&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792406954390000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Riz4A9FrCwVV5fo8OVC-u\">https://gist.github.com/xiaodaigh/6632557.js</a>&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;<br></div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div><br><br>On Friday, September 20, 2013 9:14:36 AM UTC+8, Parisa m wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div>I am a beginner! I need help with function(input, output). I have written a simple program and I can not  find the error. actually, no error message but does not work. I have slider in my result but no plot.</div><div>server:</div><div><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153)\">library(<span style=\"color:#000000\">shiny</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\">tu<span style=\"color:#071a99\">&lt;-read.csv(</span>file<span style=\"color:#071a99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;tu.csv&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#071a99\">,</span> header <span style=\"color:#071a99\">=</span> TRUE<span style=\"color:#071a99\">,</span> sep <span style=\"color:#071a99\">=</span> <span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;,&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#071a99\">)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153)\">attach(<span style=\"color:#000000\">tu</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153);min-height:16px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153)\">shinyServer(<span style=\"color:#c38809\">function</span>(<span style=\"color:#000000\">input</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">output</span>) {</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">it</span>&lt;- reactive({</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153)\">    switch(<span style=\"color:#000000\">input</span>$<span style=\"color:#000000\">tu</span>,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153)\">           <span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;id&quot;</span> = <span style=\"color:#000000\">tu</span>$<span style=\"color:#000000\">id</span>,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153)\">          <span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;size&quot;</span> = <span style=\"color:#000000\">tu</span>$<span style=\"color:#000000\">size</span>,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153)\">          <span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;months&quot;</span> = <span style=\"color:#000000\">tu</span>$<span style=\"color:#000000\">months</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153)\">  })</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153);min-height:16px\">  </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153)\">  <span style=\"color:#000000\">output</span>$<span style=\"color:#000000\">distPlot</span>&lt;- renderPlot({ hist(<span style=\"color:#000000\">it</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153);min-height:16px\">  <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>  })</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>  })</p></div><div>and my ui:</div><div><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(79,79,79)\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153)\">shinyUI(pageWithSidebar(</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153);min-height:16px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(79,79,79)\"><span style=\"color:#071a99\">  </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(176,22,0)\"><span style=\"color:#071a99\">  headerPanel(</span>&quot;statistics&quot;<span style=\"color:#071a99\">),</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153)\">  sidebarPanel( </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(176,22,0)\"><span style=\"color:#071a99\">  selectInput(</span>&quot;tu&quot;<span style=\"color:#071a99\">, </span>&quot;Variable:&quot;<span style=\"color:#071a99\">, list(</span>&quot;id&quot;<span style=\"color:#071a99\">=</span>&quot;id&quot;<span style=\"color:#071a99\">,</span>&quot;size&quot;<span style=\"color:#071a99\">=</span>&quot;size&quot;<span style=\"color:#071a99\">,</span>&quot;months&quot;<span style=\"color:#071a99\">=</span>&quot;months&quot;<span style=\"color:#071a99\">)))</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153)\"> , mainPanel(</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153)\">  plotOutput(<span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;distplot&quot;</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153);min-height:16px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153)\">     )</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153);min-height:16px\">  </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153)\">))</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153)\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153)\"><br></p></div><div>Any help pls?</div></div></blockquote></div></div></div></div>"
